{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>圈中著名閨密團陳自瑤、沈卓盈以及徐淑敏（Suki，現名徐菁遙）向來感情要好，經常相約聚會。日前，沈卓盈在社交平台分享動態，透露三人一同前往清水灣鄉村俱樂部打網球，展現貴婦級的健康運動生活。</p><figure><img alt=\"陳自瑤、沈卓盈與徐菁遙相約清水灣鄉村俱樂部打網球，貴婦團運動展現健康美。（IG/@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187747435242721280147690.jpeg/dxP3M3T_TobCQ5vBo7TfdwrGQ3ryH4HRyuYPfcrmD30\"/><figcaption>陳自瑤、沈卓盈與徐菁遙相約清水灣鄉村俱樂部打網球，貴婦團運動展現健康美。（IG/@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三人手持網球拍開心合照，素顏狀態極佳，充滿青春活力。（IG/@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187747432398852096517269.jpeg/z4xp4hL1s_-MLCxz3qg2YBK6PtRU74_XWQJKRFkCSkQ\"/><figcaption>三人手持網球拍開心合照，素顏狀態極佳，充滿青春活力。（IG/@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"沈卓盈與徐菁遙戴上遮陽帽打扮勁靚，笑容甜美十分養眼。（IG/@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187747429173301248403185.jpeg/3hM7todGuW7oG3n3W4Gy64Ht0UIpFQjrYMWrfGDFq3w\"/><figcaption>沈卓盈與徐菁遙戴上遮陽帽打扮勁靚，笑容甜美十分養眼。（IG/@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"三位靚媽換上緊身運動背心，展現完美身材曲線。（IG/@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187747426153271296953627.jpeg/Qt39pqQvEC6SNU2W3MfTJooPA0-kc3PzWl5UclpeVHI\"/><figcaption>三位靚媽換上緊身運動背心，展現完美身材曲線。（IG/@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><p>換上運動勁裝展完美身材　素顏狀態極佳</p><p>相片中，三位「靚媽」均換上黑色運動背心搭配短裙或短褲，手持網球拍在藍色網球場上燦爛合照。雖然三人已為人母，但身材依然保持得極好，線條緊緻且零贅肉。更吸睛的是，她們近乎素顏或以極淡妝容上陣，皮膚白皙透亮、齒白唇紅，滿面笑容充滿青春活力，狀態大勇，完全看不出真實年齡。</p><figure><img alt=\"靚景！（IG/@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187760854662647808901837.jpeg/neHlnKQUDzBQwyN2ZRctRnJl8jCwB-cz5XVgp-V1YKc\"/><figcaption>靚景！（IG/@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"修長美腿盡收眼底。（IG/@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187760851810390016462893.jpeg/0aa-VYo7o4G0Y5hbYjYVL4MW2eeZ59KSvfpEQL36REA\"/><figcaption>修長美腿盡收眼底。（IG/@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"完美身材曲線。（IG/@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187760848635170816350186.jpeg/aNL71IpTRYllhEH0_RiGi0ZmYmWc0Aw5gvpjBYL6YwU\"/><figcaption>完美身材曲線。（IG/@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"閨密三人合體切磋球技。（IG/@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187760845585780736076834.jpeg/IBGwjO0F9J0Sp4qg9oRmmytdF80Z47z0JXniuCV54rg\"/><figcaption>閨密三人合體切磋球技。（IG/@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"好青春！（IG/@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187760842423144448826134.jpeg/ywZcP3gxDLlJr8lN_WRYzWkqQp9eWE_FM-9oWTPvaFk\"/><figcaption>好青春！（IG/@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><p>三位女神近況各自精彩</p><p>陳自瑤最近未有劇開，將重心轉移至社交平台營運及直播帶貨，早前更遠赴新疆街頭親自帶貨，憑藉敬業態度與超強親和力獲網民大讚。而徐淑敏嫁給飲食界商人黃浩後專心相夫教女，育有三名女兒。近年她不斷進修美容、料理及各項興趣，晉身為生活品味名媛，亦經常組織閨密聚會。沈卓盈在2019年與商人結婚後淡出幕前，育有一子。她不時在社交平台分享優雅生活與育兒日常，生活十分無憂幸福。</p><figure><img alt=\"美腿！（IG/@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187761344913739776783201.png/GPZHdHcngv_PXc3aOS7n5CJgSs5gdzpYRtrVckba1XI\"/><figcaption>美腿！（IG/@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Keep得好！（IG/@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187761341960818688904176.jpeg/eSdjalB4QcMB2bOel_7WlseBLL4M43NOQwwyR0MMMkc\"/><figcaption>Keep得好！（IG/@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Keep得好！（IG/@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187761339100172288680942.jpeg/XQn5bu2oxAkYZJ31L1NE_4JRO8suaEciMRuWNjEbljY\"/><figcaption>Keep得好！（IG/@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Keep得好！（IG/@chenchiyiu）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261016/1187761335732015104274561.jpeg/d775Nk8UUlsAwRmObOvSR5TVVBmyhU4FIRvT0iEb09I\"/><figcaption>Keep得好！（IG/@chenchiyiu）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-16T12:19:49.791535+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":827,"images":13,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-16T12:00:20+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-16T12:37:43.163945+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-16T12:17:40.145095+00:00","content_hash":"b03175be0da532beb0e7519bb43b33c4976a1efd288e15bbb2b4c5d4fc5acd99","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}